// Items. `category` decides the default icon; `icon:` picks another one.
// `use:` is the scene when the item is used; it is used up unless
// `consumed: no` or the scene says "~ cancel use".

// Food and drink restore hunger and thirst.
// `plural: yes` for a name in the plural, so messages say "them".
== item wild_berries
name: wild berries
plural: yes
description: A handful of dark, sweet berries.
weight: 1
category: food
use:
    You eat the berries. Your fingers come away purple.
    ~ eat 15

== item herbal_tea
name: herbal tea
description: A flask of tea that smells of mint.
weight: 1
category: drink
icon: bottle
use:
    The tea is warm and calming.
    ~ drink 20
    ~ meter cold - 3
    ~ condition warmed_up for 6 hours

// Medical items heal. `in combat: yes` lets the player use it during a fight.
== item bandage
name: clean bandage
description: A roll of clean linen.
weight: 1
category: medical
in combat: yes
use:
    You wrap the worst of your scrapes.
    ~ heal 10

// Clothing: `equipment:` makes an item wearable. `slot` is where it goes (one
// item per slot); `armor` protects; `worn text` joins the player's description.
== item wool_coat
name: wool coat
description: A heavy coat that smells faintly of woodsmoke.
weight: 3
category: clothing
equipment:
    slot: chest
    armor: 2
    worn text: You wear a heavy wool coat.

== item boots
name: hiking boots
description: Sturdy boots with good soles.
weight: 2
category: clothing
equipment:
    slot: feet
    plural: yes
    armor: 1
    worn text: Sturdy hiking boots keep your feet dry.

// Weapons: `weapon:` makes an item wieldable. Melee weapons add strength to
// the damage, ranged ones perception.
== item carving_knife
name: carving knife
description: A small, well-kept knife with a worn wooden handle.
weight: 1
category: weapon
weapon:
    damage: 4
    type: melee
    size: 3
    attack text: [one of]the carving knife[or]the little blade[at random]

== item slingshot
name: slingshot
description: A forked stick and a strip of rubber. Surprisingly accurate.
weight: 1
category: weapon
weapon:
    damage: 3
    type: ranged
    attack text: [one of]a pebble from your slingshot[or]a well-aimed stone[at random]

// A usable item that is not used up: it only gives a bit of luck.
== item lucky_acorn
name: lucky acorn
description: A perfectly round acorn, polished smooth by many thumbs.
weight: 1
category: collectible
consumed: no
use:
    You rub the acorn for luck. [one of]You feel a little braver.[or]Nothing happens, but it's nice to hold.[at random]

== item shed_key
name: shed key
description: A small iron key, rusty at the teeth.
weight: 1
category: other

// Loot: the wild boar drops it sometimes (creatures/deep_woods.fsc).
== item truffle
name: truffle
description: A knobbly black truffle that smells wonderful.
weight: 1
category: food
use:
    You nibble the truffle. It tastes of earth and autumn.
    ~ eat 20

// `trades for`: at a shop that trades, this can be swapped for that item.
== item smooth_pebble
name: smooth pebble
description: A flat river pebble, polished smooth. Wren collects them.
weight: 1
category: collectible
trades for: herbal_tea
